                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "a2607c1b-a8c7-3754-8091-33f544100c2e",
                        "entry_id": "0ca5605a-29a5-3855-a533-c83ec7bef0b8",
                        "glosses": [
                            "свойство или состояние по значению прилагательного несдержанный; неумение, неспособность сдерживаться"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "cba9d35d-1863-4e4f-8a82-96885df55fc0",
                                "sense_id": "a2607c1b-a8c7-3754-8091-33f544100c2e",
                                "text": "Мистер Гомперс винит во всём несдержанность полиции этого города."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "cfeeac17-4e45-43be-b923-236f95b73bf4",
                                "sense_id": "a2607c1b-a8c7-3754-8091-33f544100c2e",
                                "text": "Он очень себе на уме, но порою очень бестактен, одинаково сильно проявляет то большую выдержку, то несдержанность, то скрытность, то болтливость, щеголяет своим простым происхождением и в то же время хвастает знакомством с людьми знатными .."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "86e791d6-bee2-4598-bab3-24f3e89f32c7",
                        "source_entry_id": "0ca5605a-29a5-3855-a533-c83ec7bef0b8",
                        "source_sense_id": "a2607c1b-a8c7-3754-8091-33f544100c2e",
                        "target_lang_word": "incontinence",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "incontinence",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b0517cac-3ced-3453-91c8-904eaf294ccb",
                                        "entry_id": "3634e710-c4b3-3c9f-a7cd-6f1f8f5816b9",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Lack of self-restraint, an inability to control oneself; unchastity."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "dated",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "259b2680-a623-4487-afd4-b900b5edf14d",
                                                "sense_id": "b0517cac-3ced-3453-91c8-904eaf294ccb",
                                                "text": "verbal incontinence"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3962e3eb-5223-40cb-b1bc-3bd8c3acc9b6",
                                                "sense_id": "b0517cac-3ced-3453-91c8-904eaf294ccb",
                                                "text": "Allworthy was sufficiently offended by this transgression of Jones; for notwithstanding the assertions of Mr Western, it is certain this worthy man had never indulged himself in any loose pleasures with women, and greatly condemned the vice of incontinence in others."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "05806e24-a858-4437-b2a6-aa4d06b37c8e",
                                                "sense_id": "b0517cac-3ced-3453-91c8-904eaf294ccb",
                                                "text": "There were times, during the first two years of the Biden presidency, when I came close to forgetting about it all: the taunts and the provocations; the incitements and the resentments; the disorchestrated reasoning; the verbal incontinence; the press conferences fueled by megalomania, vengeance, and a soupçon of hydroxychloroquine."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e40faa7b-9540-33e7-89e1-abebbf8f4fbd",
                                        "entry_id": "3634e710-c4b3-3c9f-a7cd-6f1f8f5816b9",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The inability of any of the physical organs to restrain discharges of their contents; involuntary discharge or evacuation (of urine or feces)."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9cf06d2f-70ed-4ea5-88f9-34192141718c",
                                                "sense_id": "e40faa7b-9540-33e7-89e1-abebbf8f4fbd",
                                                "text": "The objective is to make life easier for male colleagues and customers with urinary incontinence."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "66d2f69d-a9f5-46fb-9bc2-1f6d29afe953",
                        "source_entry_id": "0ca5605a-29a5-3855-a533-c83ec7bef0b8",
                        "source_sense_id": "a2607c1b-a8c7-3754-8091-33f544100c2e",
